{"ticker":"SYMBIOTEC","symbol":"SYMBIOTEC","instrumentId":3203982,"name":"Symbiotec Pharmalab Ltd","industry":"NSE-Medical-Ethical Drugs","about":"\"Symbiotec manufactures active pharmaceutical ingredients (APIs) and provides contract development and manufacturing (CDMO) services across organic chemistry, biotechnology and complex injectables. Its portfolio includes 60+ corticosteroid and steroidal-hormone APIs used in respiratory, dermatology, pain management, oncology, gynaecology and hormone-replacement therapies.\n\nThe company operates two industrial-scale API manufacturing facilities at Rau and Pithampur in Madhya Pradesh, with 584.67 MT chemical synthesis and 700 KL fermentation capacity. It also has biomanufacturing and complex injectable capabilities. Its facilities serve regulated pharmaceutical markets, with products and CDMO services supplied across more than 40 countries globally.\"","website":"www.symbiotec.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T14:02:22.661Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1621.3,"changePct":1.2932650256153972,"week52High":1642.4,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹10,418 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹743 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"43,051,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"69"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"23,748,925"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.64"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.5"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"6.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.78"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.28"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"40%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"82.32"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"57–60"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"-3.4%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"27.83"},{"label":"Volume","value":"287,489"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,122,736"},{"label":"Master score","value":"69"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"9"},{"label":"Price strength","value